local config = {
  str_season_maze_s3_title = "Echoes of a Dream",
  str_season_maze_s3_subtitle = "Echoes of a Dream",
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1001 = "You scan the surroundings in confusion—no enemy, no treasure... nothing. An invisible wall stops you in your tracks to a loud \"Thump!\" \n\n\"Situation analysis in progress... The energy in this dream realm fluctuates too wildly to accurately determine location.\" Enlightener's face becomes red hot from the accelerated operation. \"This is an unknown dream realm. Professor Francis mentioned he loves the uncertainty of this kind of dream realm. Furthermore, the dreamer's image remnants will sometimes appear.\"\n\nIn other words, you might meet your old friends here.\n\n\"Three departure routes have been determined. Please make your choice. Notice: Different routes offer different rewards. You are suggested to plan for the worst to avoid souring your gaming experience.\"\n\nAs if sensing your anxiety, Enlightener immediately explains, \"The worst outcome is no reward.\" That's a lot better then... right?",
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1002 = [[
"Situation analysis in progress..." Enlightener is fixated on the air all around as if many translucent jewels are moving within... Even though you don't see anything, you know you're in an unknown dream realm again. 

"Three departure routes have been determined. Please make your choice."

As if to encourage you, Enlightener tugs on your shirt and says in a hushed voice, "I have a hunch you just might catch Dream Coins this time."]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1003 = [[
"Situation analysis in progress..." Maybe it's because of the excitement and thrill from the "uncertainty" you felt in previous unknown dream realms, that you're starting to look forward to the results of Enlightener's calculations. 

"Summary: Identical to Professor Francis, you have grown to like unknown dream realms."

Enlightener seems satisfied with the conclusion. "Explanation: You should know by now I did not deceive you. The games in dreams are quite interesting. No, I do not have feelings of my own, but I can deduce how Dream Wayfarers feel."]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1004 = [[
Enlightener squats and scoops up a handful of dirt. 

"Explanation: Professor Francis once said there is a soft-hearted creature in the sea that would bind the sands seeping into its body in tears of agony until at last the pain turned into a beautiful pearl."

Enlightener pauses, looking just like any ordinary girl who is into fairy tales. "There are similar things in dreams."]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1005 = [[
"Summarizing: Nightmares are different from sweet dreams." 

Of course they are. You don't even have to think about it to say that, but for Enlightener, she has to collect countless information to formulate the same conclusion.

Is this what "Only in nightmares will the dreamers' pain be transformed into Dream Orb" means?!

You begin to wonder if Enlightener knows what it means to dream, and even if she dreams at all.]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1006 = [[
"I-It's Mr. White Dolphin!" With a cry of surprise, a young girl wearing an elegant crown daintily lifts the hem of her dress and rushes over to you.

Apparently unaware of the truth behind the dream, she happily shows you her peculiar harvest. "I planted lots of coral in this place just as Robyn suggested. Look at how much they've grown! They're truly a treasure of the sea!"

"D-Do you... see any that you like? You're welcome to take them, if you want..."]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1007 = [[
"Many of the residents have been complaining about the tunnels under the town being blocked by mud again..."

The self-proclaimed Undersea Queen sighs dejectedly. "I accidentally slipped on the mud and fell too... How unsightly..."

You comfort the young queen, suggesting that she dig out the mud and use it to fortify the town's defenses. Suddenly, her eyes light up with excitement. "Okay! I'll do as you say!"]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1008 = [[
"Dayna, Robyn, and I went to see the Lady in the Teapot again... We wanted to gain more problem-solving experience."

"She said she could teach me, but..." Still unaccustomed to her status as queen, the young girl hesitates before sharing her woes with you.

"She asked me to choose between two things: a treasure of incredible power, or an ancient story... Which would you choose?"]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1009 = [[
"Connolly! Are you playing with that White Dolphin again?" "It's time to practice your magic, Connolly!" "You promised to become a worthy queen and honor your pact, Connolly!"

Three tiny, black, and mysterious creatures follow Connolly wherever she goes, pestering her to practice her magic.

Seeing the distress on her face, you decide to join them for their interesting magical training.]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1010 = [[
You hear a familiar voice shouting in the distance. It sounds like a certain doting swordfish in the middle of recruiting allies.

"It's Dayna and the others! They're gathering people for something... Did they run into some kind of danger?" Connolly seems worried about those patrolling townsfolk.

"Sh-Should I go help them? But I don't know if I should try to find more people, or lend them a hand myself..."]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1011 = [[
You and Connolly practice magic together, reinforce the undersea town's defenses, and even repel a merman ambush. After such an eventful day, you almost forget about your pact with Enlightener.

She eventually reminds you by tugging at your hand and pointing at a shell on the ground. Inside of it lies the pure white pearl that you have been looking for.

"Ah, this child..." says Connolly as she sees little Enlightener at your side, "is she really one of Mr. Dolphin's kind?"]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1012 = [[
You quickly introduce Connolly to Enlightener, an artificial child created to maintain hope for the sake of all.

"Oh... What a good little girl you are! You must be lonely after living alone for so many years..."

Connolly embraces the little dolphin and asks, "You're looking for pearls, yes? I'll help you gather lots of them!"]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1013 = [[
Your head hums and suddenly you're seeing five, six, seven, eight, nine Enlighteners... 

"Situation analysis in progress..." Enlightener's face is now a blur, and you think her voice sounds a bit more unsettled and panicky than usual. "Warning, Dream Wayfarer must maintain sufficient Resonance with the dream to ensure stability."

Only when you snap out of it does Enlightener explain out of hindsight, "Notice: The stability of a Dream Wayfarer also affects that of Enlightener. To avoid malfunction on my part, please maintain Resonance with the dream."]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1014 = [[
"Query: Do you wish to know why Professor Francis developed the Dream Support module?" 

You nod and Enlightener closes her eyes as if straining to remember... Though to her, it's simply sorting through eons' worth of data.

"Response: Banished Caelestites were tormented by hysteria. To heal the afflicted, Professor Francis entered their dreams as a Dream Wayfarer. It is highly dangerous for a Wayfarer to move about in a dream and must have aids to accurately detect, as well as monitor, the energy fluctuations."

"Given that necessity, the professor developed the Dream Support module for me."]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1015 = [[
"Response: Professor Francis believed only science could save Caelestites. But he also believed there's a mysterious force beyond observation and comprehension..." 

"No, it's not the theology you know. Mysterious forces are mysterious because they cannot be observed or studied by current technology."

Whenever Professor Francis is brought up, it always reminds you of the time when Enlightener cleared the professor's "cache of sorrow".

Enlightener suddenly becomes alert. "Situation analysis in progress... If you wished for me to save the cache, you could do so through voice command."

That freaks you out... Is Enlightener outfitted with some sort of telepathic module too?]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1016 = [[
Enlightener wants to say something but stops right away. She seems to have a question but cannot initiate inquiry without a command. 

After getting your consent, she finally asks, "Question: I would like to know, is the world outside the same as the dream?"

It turns out Enlightener never left the tower in which she was "born". You tell her the world outside is broader, wider, and promise to take her to the mountains, the seas... everywhere in the world.

"Notice: Until then, please focus on improving your abilities." Enlightener reminds you stoically, though the exploding fireworks in the little cube behind her show her true feelings.

You've actually realized Enlightener is more than just a machine for some time now.]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1017 = [[
You're curious about what kind of dreams she's been to. 

"Retrieving information..." She closes her eyes and then opens slowly. "Sorry, you are not unauthorized to access the relevant files." But if even you aren't authorized, who in the world is?

"These are the rules my creator Professor Francis has set. He said only by gaining enough Dream EXP through traversing dreams can one develop the indomitable will and extraordinary wisdom to cope with the intricate dreams of the ancient Caelestites."

Enlightener puts a hand on your shoulder. "Summarizing: I believe you will gain access one day."]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1018 = [[
"""Retrieving information..."" She's never held back anything in answering your questions, but she seems to take longer than usual this time. 

""Sorry, my database does not contain information regarding my power source. But rest assured, based on the evaluations of my operation records, I will not run out of power, at least not while you are alive.""

You're not sure whether to worry or relax, given the ambiguous reply."]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1019 = [[
You've already realized that the dream is one you visited before, but it is now featuring what seems to be Caelestite instruments and even the environment. 

"Response: In a dream, energy fluctuations vary in different areas. To facilitate Dream Wayfarer's movement, I have marked areas with identical fluctuations. Since my database contains only Caelestite models, all fluctuations are interpreted and rendered in such style."

She pauses before proceeding carefully like she made a mistake. "Query: Should I change the rendition for you?"

But this feels perfect to you.

You truly feel at home, at least in here.]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1020 = [[
Suddenly recalling the nautilus in the Obelisk of Return, you turn to ask Enlightener about it. 

She closes her eyes. "Retrieving information..."

Her eyes open quickly this time. "Based on your description, I presume you are referring to a shell. Typically, a Caelestite would possess one or more shells. The quantity possessed did not reflect a Caelestite's wealth, but rare varieties were highly sought after, even exceeding their intrinsic values as collectibles. I advise you to invest judiciously."

Although shells have long lost their values as perceived by Caelestites now, Enlightener's advice still applies.]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1021 = [[
After learning that the Nightium is the present currency of the land, the cube next to Enlightener did not show signs of surprise, however. 

Has she already anticipated it?

"Response: I recognize that currency is a natural product of societal development, but it has no value to me."

What is valuable then, to her?

Her face turns red hot again, but you know now it's because her "brains" are working overtime. "Response: I failed to find the answer to this question, but surmising from past information, your company and compliments are the most valuable currency to me."]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1022 = [[
You've picked up some things in dreams that could help you explore the dreams before, but they didn't seem to belong in this dream... 

"Response: Energy can actually fluctuate between dreams. While the principles are unknown, studies suggest dreams do exchange energy based on certain rules. Those items followed the flow into different dreams. You could take them because they didn't belong to any one dream."

Where could they be from?

Noticing you're still lost, Enlightener replied, "They were left behind by Dream Wayfarers who entered before."]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1023 = [[
I've been in dreams for a long time, so when will this be over? 

She realizes you're getting weary. "You can take a breather. Restoring energy balance in dreams is not a short task. Usually, a dream has many levels. The more the dreamer closes themselves off to the world in reality, the more levels a dream has. However, once the energy is rebalanced, their real-life improvements will also be obvious."

Enlightener moves in closer. "Explanation: If you feel tired, I can make a hot beverage for you anytime."]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1024 = [[
As you delve deeper into dreams, you realize you're getting more and more acclimating to the rules. 

"Notice: You can take advantage of the rules and recall the Aurorians you know and summon them to help you. But please note that they won't be real, and refrain from thinking you can get away with anything in dreams. Even with my aid, you should not overlook the potential perils in a dream."

You then notice Enlightener speaks in a different tone. "The above is an automatic notice activated at certain phases by the Dream Support Module and does not reflect Enlightener's assessment of you."]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1025 = [[
You see her with her back to you and the cube next to her is recording some data... 

"Warning, do not approach!"

Detecting someone approaching, Enlightener lets out a high-pitched warning, only to then realize it's you and return the volume to normal. "Explanation: Rest assured, I will evaluate your performance fairly and award the appropriate score."

It finally dawns on you that she's been watching your every move and scoring you all along!

"Explanation: This is an additional feature I provide for you to better monitor your actions in dreams. I will give you bonus rewards each time you meet an appropriate criteria."

Well, can't underestimate her, for she truly is a master trainer.]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1026 = [[
Under her guidance, you notice there seem to be many twinkling specks drifting through the air. 

"Explanation: They are Dream Coins, the smallest unit making up dream energy. Through the rules of dreams, you can transform them into anything you want."

Seeing it's still a bit over your head, Enlightener puts it in another way. "Simply put, Dream Coins are the currency here. While it's better to collect as many as possible, I do not recommend stockpiling."]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1027 = "\"Explanation: The wandering Dream Devourers will continue to devour a dream and build lairs on the ruins. Only by removing the lairs can energy return to balance.\"\n\nShe never fails to reiterate the rules to you, again and again.\n\n\"I suggest amassing enough Dream Coins before facing the deepest part of a lair—the Miasma.\"",
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1028 = [[
"Aww... Just leave me alone! I don't know the first thing about running a country! I never should've made that pact..."

You find that Connolly has yet to return to the castle. Instead, she cries on the side of the road.

Before you have time to speak, Connolly's three little followers appear from behind her. "Don't say that, Connolly! You still have us, as well as swordfish, stingray, and Mr. Dolphin! Keep your chin up!"]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1029 = [[
Connolly admits that she still thinks about her deceased family members, her terrible relatives, and her cowardly past self. She wonders why she was forced into this position and granted such a strange power, especially since there are stronger and more talented people in the world.

"I've been thinking... Now that the town is safe, maybe it's time for me to step down as queen," she mutters morosely.

You suggest to Connolly that whenever she feels this way, she should go out for a big tasty meal or play her favorite music to cheer herself up. Sometimes, the pain of the past can be dispelled by the joy of the present.]],
  str_season_maze_s3_even_desc_1030 = [[
Taking a keen interest in Connolly's attire, Enlightener is curious about its fairytale-like origins and wants to send a beautiful pair of crystal shoes for Connolly to wear.

"Oh... B-But I'm worried I'll fall over in those shoes..."

And so, you set out in search of more suitable items. "These crystal shoes are beautiful and all... But these are closer to what I would imagine," says Connolly as she smiles sheepishly at you.]],
