  str_season_maze_s3_help_title_705 = "Dream Orb Transmission",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_101 = "The unstable elements from past dreams still linger in the realm of dreams, poised to strike reality at any moment. With the Enlightener's aid, Navigators can now venture back into the dreams to partake in diverse exploration events, enhancing their prowess within the dreams. By defeating the Ultimate Dream Devourer, there's a chance to restore stability to the dreams' energy.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_102 = "Navigators will lead the Enlightener, harnessing the power of the Dream Divination Card, to traverse diverse dream realms and trigger events within them. Throughout the exploration, Navigators can summon Aurorians and collect Dream Gear, Dream Orbs, and other dream resources to enhance their abilities. After ultimately defeating the Dream Devourer and the Ultimate Dream Devourer, the Daydream be completed, yielding rich rewards.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_201 = "The Enlightener will evaluate the Navigators' performance in dreams and record their scores. Accumulate sufficient scores to get corresponding rewards.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_202 = "After each exploration, the Enlightener will record the corresponding score based on the Dream Level and Exploration Progress. Accumulate enough scores to reach certain milestones and gain corresponding rewards. Additionally, you can get extra scores by completing Dream Quests.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_203 = "When your accumulated scores reach certain milestones, you can claim the corresponding rewards. More reward milestones will unlock at regular intervals.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_204 = "Within dreams, there are various Dream Quests to undertake, which grant additional scores on completion.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_301 = "Dreams are structured into various levels. The higher the level, the harder the challenge, and the more scores earned upon completion. Within the Dream Level screen, you can view the active Ultimate Dream Devourer on each level to devise your exploration strategy accordingly.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_302 = "You'll start at Dream Level 1 and unlock the next level upon completing the current one, and some levels will open over time. The Dream Orb feature will be available when Dream Level 3 is unlocked, providing support for your exploration.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_303 = "When entering a dream, you need to select 4 Aurorians to form the initial lineup for exploration. Aurorians deployed will inherit their Breakthrough Levels from outside dreams but won't inherit other cultivated stats or levels.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_304 = "Certain Aurorians cannot be used in Echoes of a Dream, nor can they be summoned during explorations; this list of Aurorians changes with every instance of Echoes of a Dream.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_401 = "During exploration, Navigators can control themselves and bring the Enlightener to the journey.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_402 = "The Enlightener divides a dream into different Dream Realms based on fluctuations in dream energy. Navigators can only traverse between Dream Realms, each triggering different events.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_403 = "Navigators can use the power of Dream Divination Cards to move between different Dream Realms. The Action Steps on the Dream Divination Cards determine the number of Dream Realms Navigators can move between, with some cards also offering additional resources or special effects. At the start of each round, the Enlightener will draw a certain number of Dream Divination Cards from the card deck, and Navigators can select one to play it or drag it directly onto the screen to execute its effect.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_404 = "Navigators can collect diverse resources within dreams. Dream Coins can purchase various items, Dream EXP enhances the Dream Level, Dream Interest boosts the amount of Dream Coins obtained per round, and Cyclique guarantees the safety and stability of navigation within dreams.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_405 = "In the Tool Pouch, you can view the Aurorians deployed in this exploration, the Dream Gear acquired, and the Dream Divination Cards added to the deck.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_406 = "Memories and emotions left behind by the original dreamers are enveloped layer by layer in dream energy, forming Dream Orbs. Navigators can view the Dream Orbs obtained in this exploration here and equip or synthesize them.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_407 = "Dream Devourers will strike Navigators after a set number of rounds. Only by defeating the Dream Devourers can Navigators continue their dream exploration. The Ultimate Dream Devourer is the final encounter. Defeat it to complete this exploration, gaining scores based on dream level and exploration progress.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_408 = "Here, Navigators can view the battlefield conditions and enemy information of this battle, allowing them to fine-tune their tactics. Navigators can gain corresponding rewards upon challenge completion, but upon failure, they need to consume Resonance for another attempt.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_409 = "Dream EXP gained during explorations can elevate Navigators' Dream Level, raising the levels of Aurorians and gear and unlocking new Dream Divination Cards and Dream Aid Items to bolster the Daydreams.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_501 = "Navigators can enter Dangerous Dream Realms to battle enemies and gain the chance to choose one Dream Gear upon victory.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_502 = "When Navigators enter Unknown Dream Realms, random events will be triggered. Some events require drawing 3 Dream Divination Cards and determining the sum of points. Success in the determination grants corresponding rewards.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_503 = "When entering Resource Dream Realms, Navigators can gain various types of resource rewards, including Dream Coins, Dream EXP, and Dream Orbs. The more steps are taken before entering this Dream Realm, the richer the rewards.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_504 = "After entering Unexplored Dream Realms, Navigators can dispatch any Aurorians to complete quests and earn rewards. Navigators can also choose how many rounds they will be dispatched. The more rounds, the greater the rewards. While dispatched, Aurorians cannot engage in battle and will automatically return after their quest ends.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_505 = "When entering Treasure Dream Realms, Navigators can choose one reward from various options to obtain.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_506 = "When entering the Dream Realm Tunnel, Navigators delay the Dream Devourer's assault by 1 round.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_507 = "Entering the Blank Dream Realm will not trigger any effects.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_508 = "In the Divination Dream Realm, Navigators can spend Dream Coins to reset or remove existing Dream Divination Cards.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_509 = "In Trade Dream Realms, Navigators can claim one free Dream Orb and purchase more of them if needed.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_510 = "Safe Dream Realm is where Navigators recuperate, allowing them to summon Aurorians, purchase items, buy medicines, or resurrect Aurorians to enhance their strength. In addition, infusing Dream Coins into the Dream Forge can unlock more powerful items for future challenges.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_511 = "In Dream Realm Teleportation, you will be directly teleported to their corresponding Dream Realms without passing through other dreams. Please be aware that teleportation is one-way only.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_512 = "In Dream Realm Gathering, you can purchase Dream Gear.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_513 = "In Dream Realm Summoning, you can choose an element and summon an Aurorian of the corresponding element in the target direction. Once chosen, the element cannot be changed for a given summoning.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_601 = "Navigators can summon Aurorians to join their lineup. Aurorians deployed will inherit their Breakthrough Levels from outside dreams but won't inherit other cultivated stats or levels. Increase your Dream Level to raise the level of Aurorians and their gear in dreams.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_602 = "Dream Gear is the precious knowledge and valuable relics left behind by Dream Wayfarers brave enough to explore dreams in the river of time. It can trigger various effects to assist navigators in their Daydreams.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_603 = "Navigators can use the power of Dream Divination Cards to move between different Dream Realms. The Action Steps on the Dream Divination Cards determine the number of Dream Realms Navigators can move between, with some cards also offering additional resources or special effects, including but not limited to Dream Coins, Dream Interest, Dream EXP, Cyclique, etc.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_604 = "Memories and emotions left behind by the original dreamers are enveloped layer by layer in dream energy, forming Dream Orbs. Dream Orbs can enhance the Navigators' combat power in a dream, so be careful not to let the Dream Devourer pick them up!",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_605 = "When brought into the dreams, real-world items are sometimes weathered by the dream energy, forming the Dream Aid Items. Each Dream Aid Item features unique assisting effects. Use them wisely to gain support in your explorations.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_701 = "There are 3 types of Dream Orbs: Skill Orbs, Enhancement Orbs, and Charging Orbs. Skill Orbs are used to cast skills in battle, Enhancement Orbs enhance other equipped Dream Orbs, and Charging Orbs grant faster Energy gains in battle.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_702 = "In battle, you gain 1 point of Dream Orb Energy for every tile that your Aurorians move and connect. After connecting tiles, if you have more Energy than the Energy requirement of your Dream Orbs, the skills of your equipped Dream Orbs will be cast in order from left to right.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_703 = "Dream Orbs come in 4 levels and can be upgraded up to 3-Star Dream Orbs. The higher the level of a Dream Orb, the stronger its effects.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_704 = "Two Dream Orbs of the same level can be synthesized in order to obtain a Dream Orb of the next level. If the two Dream Orbs share the same name, they will produce the same Dream Orb of a higher level. If the two Dream Orbs are different, they will produce a random Dream Orb of a higher level.",
  str_season_maze_s3_help_disc_705 = "After each Echoes of a Dream challenge ends, the 5 highest-level equipped Dream Orbs can be kept for the next challenge. When fewer than five Dream Orbs are equipped, the highest-level Dream Orbs in your backpack will be retained. Retained Dream Orbs will be reset to Lv. 1.",
  str_season_maze_s3_guide_warn_90021101 = "In Unexplored Dream Realms, Navigators can dispatch any Aurorians to complete quests and earn rewards. Navigators can also choose how many rounds they will be dispatched. The more rounds, the greater the rewards. While dispatched, Aurorians cannot engage in battle and will automatically return after their quest ends.",
  str_season_maze_s3_guide_warn_90021102 = "Tap here to select any Aurorian for dispatch. Dispatched Aurorians cannot be added to the battle lineup and will automatically return after their quest ends.",
  str_season_maze_s3_mail_gm_season = "Echoes of a Dream",
  str_season_maze_s3_mail_title_season = "Unclaimed Rewards",
  str_season_maze_s3_mail_detail_season = "The Echoes of a Dream event has ended! Here are the rewards you failed to claim during the event!"
